# An allowlist, not a denylist. Everything is excluded and the image's inputs are named
# one by one, so a secret file added to the repo later — a second .env, a database dump
# — is kept out of the build context without anyone remembering to list it here.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!alembic.ini
!alembic/

**/__pycache__
